AttestationSigil::initializeWithMultiplexer
├── given a config with senders + hashes
│   ├── it should store the sender allowlist
│   ├── it should store the hash allowlist + set the hash-allowlist flag
│   └── it should set the initialized marker
├── given a config with an empty hash allowlist
│   └── it should leave the hash-allowlist flag false (any hash) but mark initialized
├── when configured
│   └── it should emit SigilSet(id, multiplexer, account)
├── given two different multiplexers
│   └── it should key the config by multiplexer (independent allowlists)
└── given a re-init of an already-configured id (re-bind)
    ├── it should clear stale senders and stale hashes (replace, not merge)
    └── and the new hash allowlist is empty
        └── it should clear the prior pinned hash and flip the flag false (any hash)
